<title>FINLAND: Neste says to invest FIM 90 mln in Belgium.</title>
<headline>Neste says to invest FIM 90 mln in Belgium.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish state-controlled energy group Neste Oy said on Tuesday it would invest 90 million markka in its Belgian plant to boost output of intermediate products for coating and paints.</p>
<p>&quot;Neste invests $20 million (90 million markka) in its production plant in Gent, Belgium,&quot; Neste said in a statement.  </p>
<p>&quot;The investment will increase the plant's output and flexibility in the development of new products,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
